## 10. Evaluation Metrics

| Metric | Description |
|---|---|
| **mAP@50** | Mean Average Precision at IoU ≥ 0.50 (primary metric) |
| **mAP@50-95** | Mean AP averaged over IoU thresholds 0.50 to 0.95 |
| **Precision** | Correct detections / Total detections |
| **Recall** | Correct detections / Total ground truth objects |
| **Box Loss** | Bounding box regression loss (CIoU) |
| **Cls Loss** | Classification loss (BCE) |
| **DFL Loss** | Distribution focal loss for box boundaries |

### Output Artifacts

| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `best.pt` | Best model weights (by mAP@50) |
| `last.pt` | Final epoch weights |
| `results.csv` | Per-epoch metrics in CSV format |
| `results.png` | Training curves visualization |
| `confusion_matrix.png` | Class-wise prediction accuracy |
| `PR_curve.png` | Precision-Recall curve |
| `labels.jpg` | Dataset label distribution visualization |

